We have requested more funding from the industrialists, they have raised their influence within the party in doing so.

We have gained +2 resources.


@build_up_industrialists
title: Advocate for the industrialists
subtitle: Increase the influence of Germany's industries within the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; industrialist_strength += 10; industrialist_dissent -= 10; liberal_dissent += 8; labor_dissent += 8

The industrialists have always been our main interest group and the party must be reminded of this. The liberal and labor factions are displeased.

